# asdf-managed tool versions for a reproducible local setup.
#
# Scope: tools needed to *bootstrap* the project. The Rust toolchain is
# deliberately NOT managed here — rust-toolchain.toml + rustup remain the single
# source of truth (channel, components, targets, profile). Adding `rust` here
# would create a second, conflicting toolchain mechanism.
#
# `just` is pinned so a fresh machine can run `just setup` (and the rest of the
# gate) at a known version before any cargo tooling is installed. Bump alongside
# the developer-tool versions in the justfile via `just upgrade`.
just 1.40.0
